<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot; · Kilau</title></head>
<body>
<nav>
<a href="/login">Sign in</a> <a href="/signup">Sign up</a>
</nav>
<h1>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot;</h1>
<p>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot;</p>
<p><a href="/posts/7/edit">Edit</a></p>
<form method="post" action="/posts/7"><input type="hidden" name="_method" value="delete"><input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="tok123"><button>Delete</button></form>
<p><a href="/posts">All posts</a></p>

</body>
</html>
ok show escapes the title in <title> and <h1>
ok show escapes the content
ok show never holds the raw script
ok the list escapes each title
ok edit escapes the input value
ok edit posts to the post with a patch override
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>New post · Kilau</title></head>
<body>
<nav>
<a href="/login">Sign in</a> <a href="/signup">Sign up</a>
</nav>
<h1>New post</h1>
<form method="post" action="/posts"><input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="tok123">
<ul class="errors">
<li>title minimal 2 karakter</li>
<li>content wajib diisi</li>
</ul>
<p><label>Title <input name="post[title]" value="&lt;"></label></p>
<p><label>Content <textarea name="post[content]"></textarea></label></p>
<button>Save</button>
</form>

</body>
</html>
ok errors are listed, escaped
ok the typed value survives, escaped
ok a valid form lists no errors
ok edit carries the token after the method override
ok the delete form carries the token
ok the new form carries the token
ok the sign-in form carries the token
ok the sign-up form carries the token
ok a guest's nav links to sign in and sign up
ok a signed-in nav shows the email escaped
ok a signed-in nav has a sign-out form with the token
ok a hostile email is escaped in the nav
ok the sign-in form echoes the typed email escaped, never a password
